yle=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde fica localizado o ponto de partida e chegada?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todas as partidas e chegadas concentram-se nas Penhas da Sa\u00fade, em frente ao Hotel Luna Serra da Estrela, concelho da Covilh\u00e3.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias em disputa e os hor\u00e1rios?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento integra as provas de 103 km (partida \u00e0s 20:00 de dia 2), 48 km (08:00 de dia 3), 32 km (08:30) e 16 km a correr ou caminhar (09:00).<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Por que munic\u00edpios se estendem os percursos da prova?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Os percursos atravessam territ\u00f3rios de montanha \u00fanicos nos concelhos da Covilh\u00e3, Seia e Manteigas.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e at\u00e9 quando posso garantir a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais realizam-se online no portal OMDC Eventos com limite rigoroso de participantes por dist\u00e2ncia.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Estrela\u00e7or Ultra Endurance 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-02\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Penhas da Sa\u00fade, em frente ao Hotel Luna Serra da Estrela\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Covilh\u00e3\", \"addressRegion\": \"Castelo Branco\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva O Mundo da Corrida\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando se realiza a Estrela\u00e7or Ultra Endurance 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A 12\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o decorre nos dias 2 e 3 de outubro de 2026, com arranque do desafio de 103 km na noite de sexta-feira e as restantes dist\u00e2ncias no s\u00e1bado de manh\u00e3.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde fica localizado o ponto de partida e chegada?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Todas as partidas e chegadas concentram-se nas Penhas da Sa\u00fade, em frente ao Hotel Luna Serra da Estrela, concelho da Covilh\u00e3.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias em disputa e os hor\u00e1rios?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"tex